{#- BLUR_ABOVE_CEILING - quality gate: variance of Laplacian below the sharpness floor -#}
{% block subject %}The writing in your document is too blurred to read{% endblock %}
{% block defect %}The writing on the pages is out of focus. Individual characters cannot be
separated from one another, so nothing could be read with confidence — and a
guessed account number would be worse for you than none at all.{% endblock %}
{% block remedy %}Please rescan the document at {{ recommended_dpi }} DPI. If you are using a
phone, rest your elbows on a table, tap the screen on the writing so that
the camera focuses on it, and take the picture in daylight or under a bright
lamp.{% endblock %}
